  "kernel": "da331a68671f059be571c82a9701397fb49f6553",
  "kernel_repo": "Aiden-HQ/AidenHQ",
  "notes": [
    "May add authority (grants, writes, roles or secrets) in: agent-builder, ai-reviewer, apps-platform, channel-telegram, chat-lane, chief-of-staff, ci. Auto-updates accept it; turn them off to review first.",
    "One apply queue; callers wait their turn instead of being refused",
    "Every view shows the kernel's task state",
    "Task tools and Telegram /status read the kernel's task state",
    "The fleet merges and closes on maintained repos",
    "Public HTTPS by default off a tailnet; --exposure switches mode",
    "Pr-watch owns Dependabot PRs on every maintained repo",
    "Task state from the record, GET /v1/tasks/state",
    "Per-repo duties, trusted agent-build and quiet-PR upkeep",
    "Agents act; task_set_status is gone",
    "Self-hosted Primer gets the editor polish, automatic checkpoints and suggesting",
    "Detectors for unstarted delegations, merge deadlocks, ping-pong, duplicates and stale owner cards",
    "Aidenhq publish --fixes puts a closing keyword in the PR body",
    "Agents work on Primer documents directly; only sharing is reviewed",
    "Chat details close below 1920 and light mode moves to a cool neutral",
    "Wide pages fill the screen; Approvals, Settings and the wizard on the kit",
    "The task board fills the screen, with card motion and sentence-case labels",
    "Chat motion and composer polish, page transitions and toasts",
    "A top bar of sections, a ⌘K palette and a phone bottom bar",
    "Task_delegate takes after, so a sequence starts itself"
  ],
  "release": "2026.11.20.1"
}
